x1 T1 [[Uncommon Weapons|Uncommons]] ([https://supremevalues.com/mm2/ Supreme])|theme=common}}'''Candy Corn''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable in the [[Halloween Event 2026|2026 Halloween Event]] by purchasing the 8th tier in the battlepass.

== Appearance ==
Like a piece of candy corn, the blade begins at a white on the tip, then fades into an orange around the center, which then leads to the last color which is a yellow around the heel and guard. Along with that, it features a wicked sort of texture on the blade.
